## Fix Strategy Summary
The error indicates that TypeScript 5.8.3 now requires the JSX pragma `h` function to be explicitly imported when using JSX syntax. This is a breaking change where the JSX transform now requires explicit imports rather than relying on global scope.

## Detailed Execution Plan

